# CODEOWNERS — HelPhone
# ======================
# Path → expertise mapping. GitHub enforces review requirements: a PR touching
# a path listed here cannot be merged without approval from the listed owner(s).
#
# Bus-factor target: every critical path needs ≥2 people who can independently
# approve. Backups are listed second; they MUST be able to approve alone when the
# primary is unavailable. If only one person is listed, that subsystem is still
# at bus-factor 1 — a dated mitigation action is required in docs/bus-factor-ledger.md.
